[00:11.19] He's a hell of a man
[00:11.19] 他真是绝世好男人
[00:15.40] In the palm of my hand
[00:15.40] 静静躺在我掌心
[00:18.90] Everything I wanted
[00:18.90] 一切如我所愿
[00:21.11] Knew it from the moment
[00:21.11] 从那一刻便知晓
[00:24.31] He said my name
[00:24.31] 当他唤我名
[00:28.35] Felt the heat of the flame
[00:28.35] 感受到炽热火焰
[00:31.86] Dancin' 'round the kitchen
[00:31.86] 在厨房翩然起舞
[00:33.96] Damn it, we were livin'
[00:33.96] 天啊 我们正热烈活着
[00:37.11]
[00:37.16] So why am I doin what I always do?
[00:37.16] 为何我总重蹈覆辙？
[00:41.56] Findin' another way to prove
