[00:45.66]
[00:45.71] That somethin' about me can't stick around
[00:45.71] 我注定无法停留
[00:50.06] He's all the way in and I'm on the way out
[00:50.06] 他全心投入 我却准备抽身
[00:54.71] Am I just a runner runnin' from another?
[00:54.71] 难道我只会不断逃避？
[00:58.91] Missin' my chance with a damn good thing
[00:58.91] 错过这段美好缘分
